articles.description:
Dive into the world of public APIs with me, Tamyrah as I explore how to interact with real-time data sources. 
This API lets you access a vast catalog of free, open APIs — no auth required. Plug it into your next dashboard project or play around to sharpen your fetch/post skills.
API: https://api.publicapis.org/entries
(JavaScript - fetch):
https://api.publicapis.org/entries', {
  method: 'POST', // Even though this API primarily supports GET, demoing a POST
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json'
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({ title: 'Show me all cat-related APIs' })
})
.then(response => response.json())
.then(data => console.log(data))
.catch(error => console.error('Error:', error));
